               centred on 42.7240889,-84.48504, about a km south of the Union near Wilson/Stadium.
               Letting Google geocode the address keeps it right and is far less fragile.
               The .map-embed wrapper carries the ink frame and desaturation — see
               _schedule.scss; the iframe itself keeps no inline styling. #}
            <div class="map-embed">
                <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=MSU%20Union%2C%2049%20Abbot%20Rd%2C%20East%20Lansing%2C%20MI%2048824&amp;z=16&amp;output=embed" height="400" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" title="Map showing the MSU Union, 49 Abbot Rd, East Lansing, MI"></iframe>
